{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53472","headline":"白乌呈瑞赋附歌 · 孟简","name":"白乌呈瑞赋附歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"素德式昭兮何写奕，玄质从化兮爲洁白。\n符仁孝兮叶佳册，见祥瑞兮流圣泽。\n（见《文苑英华》卷八九）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟简","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53472.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53472","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}